comments[1]{created_at,author,text,edited_at}:
  "2026-09-28T06:07:42.721Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-09-28: searched the complete 2826-item snapshot for mutation receipt/output and Plan mutation titles, plus live all-status keyword AND searches for plan mutation output receipt and plan compact. pm-nilh and pm-ch59 are completed general compact-mutation deliveries; pm-5t33or is the broader output-budget programme. No individual owner was found for the Plan mutator full-collection response. Reproduction: pm plan update-step on one step of pm-a8zm returned all 15 steps. Read full live pm-nilh and pm-ch59 metadata and the complete event history before filing this distinct adapter/receipt gap.","2026-09-28T07:20:06.515Z"
